const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"一次显著，不等于多次尝试后仍显著",en:"One significant result is not a multiple-trial assessment"},body:{zh:"论文从同一批历史数据上反复尝试参数和模型的问题出发。最终展示的最好结果可能只是众多试验中的幸运样本；如果只保留获胜者，就看不到选择过程带来的偏差。试过多少配置、哪些被舍弃，都是研究证据的一部分。",en:"Repeatedly testing configurations on the same history can produce a lucky winner. Reporting that winner alone conceals selection bias. The number and identity of attempted configurations, including discarded ones, are part of the evidence needed to assess the research process."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §1 · pp. 3–5",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §1 · pp. 3–5"}}},{title:{zh:"PBO比较排名，不直接预测亏损",en:"PBO compares rankings, not future losses"},body:{zh:"作者关注样本内表现最好的配置，在样本外是否落到所有候选配置的中位数以下。这个事件是相对排名事件：它可能发生在所有配置都盈利或都亏损的情况下。把PBO直接解释成未来亏损率，会把两个不同问题混为一谈。",en:"The event concerns whether the in-sample winner ranks below the median of candidates out of sample. It is relative: this can happen when every candidate gains or when every candidate loses. PBO must not be relabeled as the probability of a future financial loss."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §2.1 · pp. 9–10",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §2.1 · pp. 9–10"}}},{title:{zh:"选择配置与拟合模型分开",en:"Separate selecting configurations from fitting models"},body:{zh:"该框架中的样本内数据，是用于在多个配置之间选出获胜者的数据，不一定是每个模型最初估计参数的训练期。论文因此能够只利用各配置的表现序列进行比较。编辑建议分别记录模型训练、配置选择和最终评价的时间范围。",en:"In-sample here means the observations used to select among configurations, not necessarily each underlying model's estimation period. This enables comparison using performance series. Editorial application: record model fitting, configuration selection and final evaluation as separate time windows."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §2.1 · p. 10",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §2.1 · p. 10"}}},{title:{zh:"输入矩阵必须同一时点可比",en:"Performance columns must share comparable timestamps"},body:{zh:"CSCV把每个尝试配置放在一列、同步观测放在一行。不同频率的结果要先对齐到共同索引，评价指标也要能在子样本计算。把某些配置缺失的日期静默删掉，或把缺失当作零表现，会改变用于比较的样本。",en:"CSCV places configurations in columns and synchronized observations in rows. Different frequencies require a common index, and the evaluation statistic must be meaningful on subsamples. Editorial caution: silently dropping missing dates or treating missing performance as zero changes the comparison."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §2.2 · p. 11",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §2.2 · p. 11"}}},{title:{zh:"对称划分是诊断，不是时间前进模拟",en:"Symmetric partitions are a diagnostic, not a walk-forward replay"},body:{zh:"方法将时间行分成偶数个区块，组合其中一半进行选择，再用互补的一半检查排名。组合会交换样本内外的角色，因此不等于每次只用过去预测未来。编辑建议把这种选择稳定性诊断与严格按时间前进的评价分别报告。",en:"The method partitions rows into an even number of blocks, selects on combinations of half and evaluates ranks on the complement. Roles are exchanged, so this is not a past-only walk-forward replay. Editorial application: report this selection diagnostic separately from chronological evaluation."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §2.2 · pp. 11–12",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §2.2 · pp. 11–12"}}},{title:{zh:"划分粒度与依赖结构限制结论",en:"Partition size and dependence limit interpretation"},body:{zh:"作者明确说明，对称划分不是适合所有情形的办法；强自相关在过细分块时可能被掩盖。相同权重也是一种设定，而不是从数据自动证明的真理。报告PBO时应一并保留候选集合、区块数量、指标和适用范围。",en:"The authors note that symmetry is not suitable for every application and fine partitions may obscure strong autocorrelation. Equal weighting is also a design choice. A PBO report should retain the candidate set, block count, performance metric and the limits under which it was calculated."},reference:{url:"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/backtest-prob.pdf",label:{zh:"2015年2月作者稿 · §5.1 · p. 23",en:"February 2015 author manuscript · §5.1 · p. 23"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"PBO评价给定候选集合和划分方法下的选择过拟合，不是某个策略未来亏损的概率。本文不提供交易策略、收益承诺或生产回测验证。",en:"PBO evaluates selection overfitting for a specified candidate set and partition scheme. It is not a strategy's probability of future loss. This guide provides neither a trading strategy nor a return promise or production backtest validation."}};export{e as default};
